        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: New York City, Lower Manhattan\n- Buildings: Central Park Place, World Trade Center, 888 7th Avenue\n- Companies: NYS Collection, Emery Roth & Sons\n- Topics: building height ranking, retail locations\n\nFacts:\n- Central Park Place is a 56-story condominium building in New York City.\n- The original World Trade Center was a complex of seven buildings in Lower Manhattan, New York City, United States.\n- Emery Roth & Sons designed 888 7th Avenue.\n- 888 7th Avenue is tied with Central Park Place as the 65th tallest building in New York City.\n- NYS Collection started with a retail location at the World Trade Center in New York City.",
